			"Message": "docs(Vine): Update README with Rust 1.95.0 MSRV, shim docs, and refine formatting\n\nUpdate README.md to reflect the new workspace MSRV of Rust 1.95.0 (edition 2024), add a dedicated Shim Compatibility section documenting the TierShim interception system, move funding acknowledgements and project maintainers to the footer, and replace wide-space formatting throughout with explicit HTML entities and emoji spacing for consistent rendering.\n\nFix heading markers in Architecture.md to use HTML entities for the em-space separator, ensuring cross-platform heading rendering consistency.\n\nAdd a comprehensive SECURITY.md with the Land ecosystem's unified vulnerability reporting policy, covering scope, supported versions, reporting process, and coordinated disclosure procedures.",
